                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "28b2fd05-f69c-35ee-9404-8c71b22814d7",
                        "entry_id": "d09ecf93-cc9c-3beb-a09c-99f2a2e7e55e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "nieetyczne prowadzenie się, postępowanie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb1de911-4219-4f1f-8494-7334d97fc632",
                                "sense_id": "28b2fd05-f69c-35ee-9404-8c71b22814d7",
                                "text": "Takiej tępoty, połączonej z niekompetencją, bezinteresownym szkodnictwem lub zawiścią, zakłamaniem i zwykłym łajdactwem dawno nie widziałem"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a850c663-44d2-3677-8f28-0c53eef777be",
                        "entry_id": "d09ecf93-cc9c-3beb-a09c-99f2a2e7e55e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ogół łajdaków"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "offensive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ded3d075-5cc7-44ce-a512-a6411d01b1a6",
                                "sense_id": "a850c663-44d2-3677-8f28-0c53eef777be",
                                "text": "Na miłość boską, niech lokaje odgonią całe to łajdactwo sprzed bramy!"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd8fdae9-f761-34c2-8416-6ea4db290105",
                        "entry_id": "d09ecf93-cc9c-3beb-a09c-99f2a2e7e55e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "nieetyczny postępek"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdd07db2-52a8-485c-9040-9ccf00e3d893",
                                "sense_id": "dd8fdae9-f761-34c2-8416-6ea4db290105",
                                "text": "Wszystko obmyślałem i ręczę panu, że się powiedzie! — mówił spokojnie Moryc, popierając swoje wywody szeregiem cyfr i rozmaitych podstępów, łajdactw, oszustw, któremi chciał zabić Borowieckiego"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.3\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1790d06e-e1aa-4568-8c6e-04adaedf9464",
                        "source_entry_id": "d09ecf93-cc9c-3beb-a09c-99f2a2e7e55e",
                        "source_sense_id": "28b2fd05-f69c-35ee-9404-8c71b22814d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "roguery",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "roguery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82f4056a-c10c-3dd5-b08a-5662263d3d00",
                                        "entry_id": "cbf39aae-106e-3cc3-bd7f-2f3fdc8c7029",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "malicious or reckless behaviour"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25a41670-e750-4fc1-b974-e4ce9c0656dd",
                                                "sense_id": "82f4056a-c10c-3dd5-b08a-5662263d3d00",
                                                "text": "Sincerely I begin to wish I had never made such a Point of gaining so very good a character, for it has led me into so many curst Rogueries that I doubt I shall be exposed at last."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17f9633e-6ed7-33f1-8fb8-d0dde43b6d97",
                                        "entry_id": "cbf39aae-106e-3cc3-bd7f-2f3fdc8c7029",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mischievous behaviour"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "89363994-e31c-4dc0-9c66-62eb6d5d2ffd",
                        "source_entry_id": "d09ecf93-cc9c-3beb-a09c-99f2a2e7e55e",
                        "source_sense_id": "28b2fd05-f69c-35ee-9404-8c71b22814d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "skullduggery",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "skullduggery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e024095c-0805-3656-bb49-c3111af272d8",
                                        "entry_id": "e3b3fcb8-9104-3659-aeb9-e05de85cdbe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "US spelling of skulduggery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7ddfc24-927d-408f-aca8-883a67a76465",
                                                "sense_id": "e024095c-0805-3656-bb49-c3111af272d8",
                                                "text": "And I have another reason which I will express to my St Paul friends, and that is, that they have always been controlled in their political action here by a class of men who have always some traps set for the country members—by men who are always up to this border ruffian kind of trickery—this kind of skullduggery, as it is called in Minnesota. And now St. Paul allows herself to be controlled by these same border ruffian politicians."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb4f1c22-02ce-4d43-897e-0dc35868aa05",
                                                "sense_id": "e024095c-0805-3656-bb49-c3111af272d8",
                                                "text": "The crew manager collects all the money from his workers. They operate in more or less close formation, with the manager lurking around the edges, riding herd in his car or walking between cover points. Thus, the solicitor has little chance for skullduggery. His receipts are numbered and he has to account for them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a6f2610-172a-46fe-8b11-aca530b4c2e2",
                                                "sense_id": "e024095c-0805-3656-bb49-c3111af272d8",
                                                "text": "Government members are now talking about skullduggery. Whose skullduggery are they referring to? If there is any skullduggery it will be because many eligible people are denied the opportunity to cast a valid vote, and that is all the more reason for the House to pass the Electoral Law Amendment Bill today. I do not want any skullduggery in elections at any time, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "180edbca-2b22-4369-8be5-26ddeced65b1",
                                                "sense_id": "e024095c-0805-3656-bb49-c3111af272d8",
                                                "text": "What exhibition of rapaciousness, race prejudice and political spoliation could be cheaper, commoner, or meaner? These are the little tyrannies and petty skullduggeries that make bitter the relations between the races."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9ba9f3f7-8595-46bd-8d25-4c51e45602c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "d09ecf93-cc9c-3beb-a09c-99f2a2e7e55e",
                        "source_sense_id": "28b2fd05-f69c-35ee-9404-8c71b22814d7",
